# Working notes. These were tracked once, and therefore served: a draft
# Wikipedia article about ourselves, a directory-spend plan naming a third
# party, and Search Console steps were all readable at lunarasociety.com/tmp/.
# An institution whose product is evidentiary rigor cannot host its own
# notability drafts on its own origin.
tmp/
scratch/

# Only six stray Playwright report templates were ever committed here, and
# they were being served from our origin as though they were ours.
node_modules/

# Prospect letters and the scan behind them. Committing these would
# publish them: everything in this repository is served, which is how
# tmp/ ended up readable at lunarasociety.com/tmp/ above. A letter
# assessing a named company's compliance posture, hosted on the domain
# of the institution that wrote it, is the same mistake with a worse
# subject. They live outside the repository; outreach/README.md says
# where.
outreach/letters/
outreach/scan*.json
outreach/prospects/
